    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2495320/extras/6e346f82a6a5cfa58bef6c8055aade3b.avif?t=1744514336\" data-has-big /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Grand Adventure, A Calm Retreat</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore a floating continent</strong> teeming with magical creatures known as MoNs. These creatures love battling alongside the wizards that catch and care for them.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Catch magical MoNs</strong>, learn powerful spells, and battle other wizards across the continent.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An Epic Adventure unfolds</strong> as you explore each route and city. Return to your town at any time to plant some crops, harvest some fruit, or relax with the MoNs you've caught! Maybe some NPCs will even move into your town!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2495320/extras/ce1a0c82a3c23518ba878955cbac54b7.avif?t=1744514336\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The 9 Houses</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2495320/extras/cabff576d66a67c88ae47fe5378cbce9.avif?t=1744514336\" /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Each House rules over a city</strong> and is led by a powerful Archwizard. Each Archwizard uses a unique strategy in battle, built around their signature MoN.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Players will travel</strong> from city to city, battling wizards and Archwizards along the way. With each victory, players will gain new spells that allow them to unlock new paths and new ways to traverse the floating continent.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2495320/extras/3d5fd825f73154a1d5bd9b677007615d.avif?t=1744514336\" /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MoNs can belong to 2 Houses</strong>, which will influence their strengths, weaknesses, abilities, and move pool.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The 6 Starter MoNs</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Monsterpatch features 6 Starter MoNs</strong>, and players get to <strong>pick 2</strong> to accompany them on their journey! Which 2 will you choose?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2495320/extras/7d4d61f4fff818d407fbb1eea8f251d0.avif?t=1744514336\" /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Master the Spellbook</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>As a Wizard, </strong>you will learn many spells during your adventure! These spells are stored in your Spellbook and can affect nearby objects, MoNs, and the environment around you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Spells can be upgraded</strong> after completing certain in-game feats. Some believe there are a handful of secret and very powerful spells that only the best wizards can learn.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2495320/extras/c6d40c8cccba222ac503adf65d69c3df.poster.avif?t=1744514336\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2495320/extras/c6d40c8cccba222ac503adf65d69c3df.webm?t=1744514336\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2495320/extras/c6d40c8cccba222ac503adf65d69c3df.mp4?t=1744514336\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2495320/extras/6e441540239fb4fd4b3bd1a0efb11bb5.avif?t=1744514336\" /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Customize Your Town</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Design </strong>your town layout however you'd like. You have complete control over elevation, water, dirt, paths, fences, trees, and much more!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2495320/extras/35114411ea87482ac673fea04253dcfa.poster.avif?t=1744514336\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2495320/extras/35114411ea87482ac673fea04253dcfa.webm?t=1744514336\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2495320/extras/35114411ea87482ac673fea04253dcfa.mp4?t=1744514336\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlock Blueprints</strong> for unique structures and town decorations.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2495320/extras/1a84d33c244f9945980b2e92c4a45036.poster.avif?t=1744514336\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2495320/extras/1a84d33c244f9945980b2e92c4a45036.webm?t=1744514336\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2495320/extras/1a84d33c244f9945980b2e92c4a45036.mp4?t=1744514336\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every object</strong> in the game will be available for you to place in your town, allowing for limitless customization.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2495320/extras/2250b76039a9b912182146333d65dfe6.avif?t=1744514336\" /></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Recruit Townsfolk </strong>to help expand and manage your town. Perhaps you can even gift them MoNs for their own team, and have some friendly battles!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2495320/extras/613fc9a1f460459db1e635917fdb6e0c.avif?t=1744514336\" /></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Fast-Paced Battle System</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2495320/extras/8120f5d8d43b9a66799e8b430ea5a145.poster.avif?t=1744514336\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2495320/extras/8120f5d8d43b9a66799e8b430ea5a145.webm?t=1744514336\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2495320/extras/8120f5d8d43b9a66799e8b430ea5a145.mp4?t=1744514336\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Create a team composition</strong> of 4 MoNs that is full of powerful synergies and unique interactions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grind through the wild </strong>with fast-paced encounters. With an adjustable battle speed, players can choose what feels right to them.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customize</strong> the stats, moves, and held item of each MoN on your team. There are tons of strategies to discover, and many ways to express your creativity when it comes to team building.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2495320/extras/1c32b027ab3cbbab8ccea6470466abe8.poster.avif?t=1744514336\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2495320/extras/1c32b027ab3cbbab8ccea6470466abe8.webm?t=1744514336\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2495320/extras/19f3b651b439de97c1c0c99c6cc9e1be.avif?t=1744514336\" /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>2 Versions, 1 Game</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2495320/extras/34cf4c85efa70eea2827094aeb48b2eb.avif?t=1744514336\" /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Monsterpatch comes with 2 versions in the game: Skyfarer Version &amp; Aurora Version!</i></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>When creating a save file in Monsterpatch</strong>, players will be able to choose which version of the game they want to play: <strong>Skyfarer </strong>version or <strong>Aurora </strong>version.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2495320/extras/6e346f82a6a5cfa58bef6c8055aade3b.avif?t=1744514336\" data-has-big /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Grand Adventure, A Calm Retreat</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore a floating continent</strong> teeming with magical creatures known as MoNs. These creatures love battling alongside the wizards that catch and care for them.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Catch magical MoNs</strong>, learn powerful spells, and battle other wizards across the continent.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An Epic Adventure unfolds</strong> as you explore each route and city. Return to your town at any time to plant some crops, harvest some fruit, or relax with the MoNs you've caught! Maybe some NPCs will even move into your town!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2495320/extras/ce1a0c82a3c23518ba878955cbac54b7.avif?t=1744514336\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The 9 Houses</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2495320/extras/cabff576d66a67c88ae47fe5378cbce9.avif?t=1744514336\" /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Each House rules over a city</strong> and is led by a powerful Archwizard. Each Archwizard uses a unique strategy in battle, built around their signature MoN.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Players will travel</strong> from city to city, battling wizards and Archwizards along the way. With each victory, players will gain new spells that allow them to unlock new paths and new ways to traverse the floating continent.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2495320/extras/3d5fd825f73154a1d5bd9b677007615d.avif?t=1744514336\" /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MoNs can belong to 2 Houses</strong>, which will influence their strengths, weaknesses, abilities, and move pool.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The 6 Starter MoNs</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Monsterpatch features 6 Starter MoNs</strong>, and players get to <strong>pick 2</strong> to accompany them on their journey! Which 2 will you choose?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2495320/extras/7d4d61f4fff818d407fbb1eea8f251d0.avif?t=1744514336\" /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Master the Spellbook</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>As a Wizard, </strong>you will learn many spells during your adventure! These spells are stored in your Spellbook and can affect nearby objects, MoNs, and the environment around you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Spells can be upgraded</strong> after completing certain in-game feats. Some believe there are a handful of secret and very powerful spells that only the best wizards can learn.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2495320/extras/c6d40c8cccba222ac503adf65d69c3df.poster.avif?t=1744514336\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2495320/extras/c6d40c8cccba222ac503adf65d69c3df.webm?t=1744514336\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2495320/extras/c6d40c8cccba222ac503adf65d69c3df.mp4?t=1744514336\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2495320/extras/6e441540239fb4fd4b3bd1a0efb11bb5.avif?t=1744514336\" /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Customize Your Town</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Design </strong>your town layout however you'd like. You have complete control over elevation, water, dirt, paths, fences, trees, and much more!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2495320/extras/35114411ea87482ac673fea04253dcfa.poster.avif?t=1744514336\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2495320/extras/35114411ea87482ac673fea04253dcfa.webm?t=1744514336\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2495320/extras/35114411ea87482ac673fea04253dcfa.mp4?t=1744514336\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlock Blueprints</strong> for unique structures and town decorations.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2495320/extras/1a84d33c244f9945980b2e92c4a45036.poster.avif?t=1744514336\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2495320/extras/1a84d33c244f9945980b2e92c4a45036.webm?t=1744514336\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2495320/extras/1a84d33c244f9945980b2e92c4a45036.mp4?t=1744514336\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every object</strong> in the game will be available for you to place in your town, allowing for limitless customization.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2495320/extras/2250b76039a9b912182146333d65dfe6.avif?t=1744514336\" /></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Recruit Townsfolk </strong>to help expand and manage your town. Perhaps you can even gift them MoNs for their own team, and have some friendly battles!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2495320/extras/613fc9a1f460459db1e635917fdb6e0c.avif?t=1744514336\" /></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Fast-Paced Battle System</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2495320/extras/8120f5d8d43b9a66799e8b430ea5a145.poster.avif?t=1744514336\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2495320/extras/8120f5d8d43b9a66799e8b430ea5a145.webm?t=1744514336\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2495320/extras/8120f5d8d43b9a66799e8b430ea5a145.mp4?t=1744514336\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Create a team composition</strong> of 4 MoNs that is full of powerful synergies and unique interactions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grind through the wild </strong>with fast-paced encounters. With an adjustable battle speed, players can choose what feels right to them.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customize</strong> the stats, moves, and held item of each MoN on your team. There are tons of strategies to discover, and many ways to express your creativity when it comes to team building.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2495320/extras/1c32b027ab3cbbab8ccea6470466abe8.poster.avif?t=1744514336\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2495320/extras/1c32b027ab3cbbab8ccea6470466abe8.webm?t=1744514336\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2495320/extras/19f3b651b439de97c1c0c99c6cc9e1be.avif?t=1744514336\" /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>2 Versions, 1 Game</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2495320/extras/34cf4c85efa70eea2827094aeb48b2eb.avif?t=1744514336\" /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Monsterpatch comes with 2 versions in the game: Skyfarer Version &amp; Aurora Version!</i></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>When creating a save file in Monsterpatch</strong>, players will be able to choose which version of the game they want to play: <strong>Skyfarer </strong>version or <strong>Aurora </strong>version.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
